---
const title = "TEST - Full Homepage Works";
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{title}</title>
    <style>
        body {
            background: #0b0b0d;
            color: white;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
        }
        .success {
            color: #00ff00;
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin: 2rem 0;
        }
        .test-links {
            margin: 2rem 0;
        }
        .test-links a {
            display: inline-block;
            margin: 0.5rem;
            padding: 1rem 2rem;
            background: rgba(255, 60, 43, 0.2);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 60, 43, 0.5);
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        .test-links a:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 60, 43, 0.3);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <h1 class="success">✅ ROUTING WORKS!</h1>
    <p>If you can see this page, then Astro routing is working correctly.</p>
    
    <div class="test-links">
        <a href="/">Go to Homepage</a>
        <a href="/coming-soon">Go to Coming Soon</a>
        <a href="/test-homepage">Reload This Test</a>
    </div>
    
    <p>Current URL: <code>http://localhost:4321/test-homepage</code></p>
    <p>If the "Go to Homepage" button takes you to coming-soon instead of the full homepage, there's still a routing issue.</p>
</body>
</html>
